  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preventing Chronic Childhood Malnutrition During the First 1000 Days of Life Through Comprehensive Approaches to improve Health, Nutrition, Water and Sanitation Systems in Prioritized Communities of Sucumbios and Chimborazo, Ecuador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to improve children&apos;s lives by preventing chronic childhood malnutrition, or stunting , through implementing health and nutrition interventions and improving water, sanitation, and hygiene (WASH) systems in Sucumbios and Chimborazo provinces.&#xc9c0;&#xc5ed;&#xc0ac;&#xd68c; &#xc911;&#xc2ec; &#xc601;&#xc591; &#xbc0f; &#xbcf4;&#xac74; &#xd504;&#xb85c;&#xadf8;&#xb7a8;(intervention)&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xb4e4;&#xc758; &#xc0dd;&#xc560; &#xcd5c;&#xcd08; 1&#xcc9c; &#xc77c; &#xb3d9;&#xc548;&#xc758; &#xc601;&#xc591;&#xc0c1;&#xd0dc; &#xac1c;&#xc120;, &#xc784;&#xc0b0;&#xbd80; &#xbc0f; 2&#xc138; &#xbbf8;&#xb9cc; &#xc544;&#xb3d9;&#xc758; &#xc548;&#xc804;&#xd55c; &#xc2dd;&#xc218; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xc218;&#xc778;&#xc131; &#xac10;&#xc5fc;&#xc9c8;&#xd658; &#xc608;&#xbc29;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective will be achieved by implementing holistic community-based models that promote intersectoral local coordination: ensure WASH services are comprehensive, safe, and resilient to the impacts of climate change: improve health and nutrition access; enhance service coverage; foster healthy practices; and actively involve the Government and Ecuadorian society in addressing the root causes of stunting.</narrative>
  </description>
